    "legalBasisForProcessingDescription": "We process your data based on the following legal bases:\n\n• Your consent for feedback submissions via Wiredash and app analytics.\n• Performance of a contract for processing payments and managing subscriptions through RevenueCat.\n• Our legitimate interest in ensuring the App operates effectively by using Sentry for crash reporting.",
